// An inventory report as a four-dependency `rene build`: generic
// containers (`collections`), the domain layer folding transactions into a
// BST stock map (`store`), and two polyffi packages in one link —
// `console` owns the report's format strings, `pricing` the money math.
// The polyffi surface is deliberately varied: unit-returning prints, a
// four-parameter import crossing packed, and a generic `scale` whose `i64`
// instance is emitted by both the store layer and the app — the duplicate
// textures must collapse to one definition at link, same as the
// `collections` fold instances both consumers monomorphize.

// The dependency cone is pure manifest work first: four packages, every
// constraint satisfied by the declared versions, `store` pulling
// `collections` and `pricing` from the app's vendor tree by relative path.
// RUN: %rene inspect --manifest-path %S/inventory/rene.ncl --build-dir %t.bdir --frozen --solved | %FileCheck %s --check-prefix=SOLVED

// SOLVED: "resolution": {
// SOLVED-NEXT: "collections": "1.4.2"
// SOLVED-NEXT: "console": "0.3.1"
// SOLVED-NEXT: "core": "0.1.0"
// SOLVED-NEXT: "inventory": "0.1.0"
// SOLVED-NEXT: "pricing": "2.0.0"
// SOLVED-NEXT: "store": "1.0.3"

// RUN: %rene build --manifest-path %S/inventory/rene.ncl --build-dir %t.bdir %rrc_linker | %FileCheck %s --check-prefix=LISTING

// LISTING: {{[/\\]}}dev{{[/\\]}}inventory

// RUN: %t.bdir/dev/inventory%exe_ext | %FileCheck %s

// The report: rows in sku order out of the BST's in-order fold, the
// warnings, then the totals — sku 17 crosses the ten-unit threshold so its
// line carries the volume discount (10 x 2.50 discounted to 22.50), and
// the oversold sku 9999 shows its negative quantity rather than hiding it.
// CHECK:      inventory report (4 skus)
// CHECK-NEXT: sku 0017: 10 x 2.50
// CHECK-NEXT: sku 0504: 2 x 75.00
// CHECK-NEXT: sku 1002: 6 x 13.50
// CHECK-NEXT: sku 9999: -1 x 0.00
// CHECK-NEXT: low stock: sku 0504 (2 left)
// CHECK-NEXT: low stock: sku 9999 (-1 left)
// CHECK-NEXT: total 253.50
// CHECK-NEXT: with tax 273.78

// The optimized build is the same report.
// RUN: %rene build --manifest-path %S/inventory/rene.ncl --build-dir %t.bdir --profile release %rrc_linker | %FileCheck %s --check-prefix=RELEASE
// RUN: %t.bdir/release/inventory%exe_ext | %FileCheck %s

// RELEASE: {{[/\\]}}release{{[/\\]}}inventory
